<title>USA: Illinova Corp sets $100 mln in snr notes.</title>
<headline>Illinova Corp sets $100 mln in snr notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Illinova Corp was priced on Friday, according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER ILLINOVA CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 2/01/2004</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.379  FIRST PAY DATE 8/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.24 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD 80 BPS     CALLABLE  NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
